{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FinRoute Saving Planner 是一款介面簡潔、以目標為本的個人儲蓄管理 App，適合希望為黃金、白銀、股票、加密貨幣等各類資產訂立儲蓄目標並持續追蹤進度的使用者。透過清晰的完成百分比與目標洞察，你能隨時掌握已儲存金額、尚欠金額，以及與目標之間的距離。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>儲蓄目標進度一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>App 支援靈活建立個人化儲蓄目標，並以視覺化方式呈現整體進度。你可記錄買入與賣出交易，透過詳細交易紀錄與表現洞察回顧儲蓄成果。資料經 CloudKit 安全同步至私人 iCloud 帳戶，介面現代簡潔。App 僅供個人儲蓄與目標追蹤用途，不提供財務或投資建議。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-240-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-241-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-242-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-243-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-244-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-245-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FinRoute Saving Planner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T23:58:28.117462+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}